# Both images build with the repository root as context and copy it whole.
# Source layout is deliberately NOT filtered: each tool reaches into the
# other's package (`crustify.core`), so a partial context breaks the build.
# What is excluded is what no image can use and what would bloat the context.
.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/target
crustify/
